---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Adiviath Technologies" description="Adiviath Technologies makes niche software for specific real-world needs.">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Adiviath</p>
    <h1>A company built around specific needs.</h1>
    <p>Adiviath Technologies builds niche software: products we run ourselves and tools built for specific businesses.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-grid">
    <h2>Why we exist</h2>
    <div>
      <p class="lead">Some jobs need a tool of their own.</p>
      <p>
        We start by understanding how the work gets done today: the tools people
        use, the records they keep, and the tasks they repeat by hand.
        That helps us decide what the software actually needs to do.
      </p>
      <p>With Pharmulo, that means letting retailers order online while wholesalers continue using their existing system.</p>
      <p>For Naveen Logistics, it means bringing lorry receipts, freight bills, payments, and customer accounts into one system.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mark-story">
    <Logo />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our mark</p>
      <h2>Software shaped around the need.</h2>
      <p>
        A small apricot center, with a cocoa form shaped around it. Our mark is a
        reminder to start with the need and build from there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
